WEBVTT

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.840
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:53.750
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:10.270
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.340
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:23.950
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:31.750
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:36.390
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:40.200
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.500
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:49.270
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:53.610
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:56.850
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:03.050
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:08.990
Hear my Song of Death!

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:14.100
I believe this is it.
Miss, we have arrived.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:22.000
It's useless.
I mean, we've tried so many times.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.570
It'll be fine this time.

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:27.340
I was informed he's the successor of the Inukami User clan.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:30.010
The lineage of the Kawahira family.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.520
I'm sure he definitely can help you.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.390
I told you I don't want that.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.550
It's only going to add casualties.

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:39.760
Besides...

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.060
What was that?

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:50.900
Come on, Keita.
Punishment isn't over yet.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.000
I give up.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:57.410
Nope, I won't forgive you until you tell me everything about Maiko.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.180
Umm...

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.480
Excuse me.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.080
Could you be Keita?

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:06.450
Keita Kawahira the Inukami User?

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:08.020
Yeah, I am.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.520
What about it?

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:15.520
No!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:19.160
Sorry for the late introduction.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:22.770
I am Sebastian, the Sindo family's butler.

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.230
Sebas... thing?

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:28.740
Oh, Hake told me.
You have a job request, right?

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:31.310
He told me to ask the details from you.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:32.370
Yes.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.020
Well, let us begin.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.730
Wait.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.860
What is this all about?

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:53.930
No more talking.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.940
Not so fast, darn you.

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.740
As expected.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:07.980
Otherwise coming here would be meaningless.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.090
Take this.

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:17.390
This is nothing.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.060
How's this?

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:27.700
Take it outside, you two!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.070
I deeply apologize.

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:38.010
Knowing I'd be rude,
I had to test your ability.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:42.280
You didn't have to attack me in a black bikini, though.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.310
Good grief.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.950
Why are we bringing these kids along?

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:50.150
It's obvious my problem is too much for them.

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:54.060
What's your problem?
You don't even know us.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.090
Stop it.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:56.530
Keita.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:05:02.230
No matter what you say,
I want to take a chance on him.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:06.570
Granted, it is also true that
I have nobody else to rely on.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:13.410
Mr. Kawahira, we're looking for a strong spiritual power user.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:17.150
Or perhaps a martial artist with a heart stronger than anyone.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:21.220
One that can compete with the strongest and worst being.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:24.690
So, who am I supposed to fight?

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.190
It's...

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:30.690
I'm car sick.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:32.630
What?

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.400
I'm not feeling good.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.900
Wait, calm down!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.670
Hold it. Swallow it.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:43.310
It's too late.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:06.260
As expected of a
Sindo conglomerate's mansion.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.900
If I sell this vase over here,
I can pay ten years worth of my rent.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:15.140
So if we succeed at this job, we'll get lots of money?

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.810
Exactly.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:19.170
All right!
By the way, you're naked.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.240
I'm always like this.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.310
I guess that's true.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:28.650
No matter how strong those kids are, they still can't beat him.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:31.650
They'll never defeat him.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.220
Please stop.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.460
I'm stepping down too!
He's a monster!

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.010
It's better if they leave immediately.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.880
Tomorrow is already too late.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.790
It pierces...

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:06.860
Does it fit me?

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:09.190
Yeah, you look pretty good.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.290
You're looking dapper too.

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:13.530
What?

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.160
A song?

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:19.670
Is that Kei the one singing it?
What a gloomy song.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.270
Keita?

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.580
Let's dig in!

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.850
Yummy.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.650
Totally.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:38.620
I'm going to eat until I drop.

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.660
That's my meat.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.030
Give it back.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.730
There's still lots of food.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:46.600
Geez.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:49.930
So, are you going to tell us the details of the job already?

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:55.040
The Sindo family is an honorable lineage

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.040
dating back some 150 years.

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.140
Give it back.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:02.080
But during the time of
Miss Kei's grandfather,

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.810
the family fell into poverty.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:08.820
Her grandfather chose to restore their fortune

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:12.690
with a way that should never be used!

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:13.520
You mean...

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:17.530
He made a contract with a Reaper.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:26.670
It is said that with the right price, a Reaper can grant a man's wish.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:29.070
With that power,

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:32.880
he promised the Sindo family would amass a huge fortune.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:35.010
However, the price was...

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:41.820
He would appear on a Sindo family member's birthday every year.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:45.550
There, he would cause fear to them.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.360
That is one part of the contract.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:50.060
There's more?

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:54.130
Everyone in the Sindo family will be killed by the Reaper.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:56.670
On their 20th birthday.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:00.640
He went easy on us until last year.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.540
But not this year.

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:05.070
He will come for my life.

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.980
Along with those who try to protect me.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:11.450
Are you saying...

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:15.820
That's right.
Tomorrow is my 20th birthday.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.550
No way.

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:18.590
It can't be.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:21.860
No matter how I look at it...

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.890
You look like you're 13 or so, if not 7 or 8.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:29.300
I thought at most you're just around Tomohane's age.

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:30.300
Right?

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:34.340
Umm, what are you two talking about?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.470
You better not hit on her.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.210
Hey, I'd never...

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:41.810
I most certainly do not have that kind of "special" interest!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:43.980
But, the world sure is diverse.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.080
Yeah, nobody would ever believe she's 20.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.850
Yeah, it's unbelievable.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:51.790
Hey. Aren't there other things you should be surprised about?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:55.460
And why are you laughing too?

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.030
Forgive me.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:03.170
There's no need to laugh, I got this petite figure from my mother.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.370
Well, don't worry.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.770
I'll protect you.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.210
Then...?

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.010
I'll take this job.

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.840
Leave it to me, Keita Kawahira the Inukami User.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.410
Were you even listening?

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:22.120
Thank you, we will repay you with anything you want!

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.150
Seriously?

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:26.590
We don't mind even if you take all of the Sindo family's fortune.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:30.730
As long as you protect Miss Kei.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.860
Worry not, Sebasthing.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:36.030
I mean, Keita has me by his side.

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:39.740
You shouldn't worry either,
Kei Sindo.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.940
You two.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:47.210
What?

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.910
What's this sound?

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.950
It can't be...

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:54.420
Hey, what's wrong?

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:57.990
No.

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:02.590
No!

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:07.600
Keita, something's coming.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.230
"Inukami!"

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.330
Woof woof.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.940
Ladies and gentlemen.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:24.380
Harvest day is finally here.
The girl's 20th birthday.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:28.280
The time to harvest the soul.
The moment to pluck the flesh.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.650
I'm the greatest.
The Reaper amongst Reapers.

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:33.890
My name is the Sea of Violence.

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:37.830
I've kept you waiting, Kei Sindo.
Now, let's start the tragic night.

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.530
What's wrong?

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.770
Is there no one who will face me this year?

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:47.940
Please don't disappoint me.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:48.770
Hey.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.570
Kei Sindo, it has been a year, hasn't it?

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.980
I've been terrorizing you for years,

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.940
but your death will be instant.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.980
Be grateful for my mercy.

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:01.950
Hey.

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.390
Are you listening, upside down idiot?

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.590
Who are you?

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:11.330
Who do you think I am,
Sea of Violence?

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:14.100
How do you know my name?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.100
You just told us!

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:18.200
Oh, that's right. And you are?

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:22.440
I'm the Inukami User hired to defeat you.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.210
And his Inukami, Yoko.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.410
I have killed many wrestlers and karate fighters.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:34.850
But it's the first time I'll kill a User and an Inukami Yoko.

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.150
Thanks for the entertainment.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:40.160
Now, come, you who are standing upside down.

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:43.430
You don't know that you're upside down?

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:45.930
I'm the one reversed?

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:50.400
And by the way, aren't you one day off?

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.370
What? One day off?

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.870
Poor thing.

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:59.340
He really made a mistake.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.040
How pathetic.

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:01.840
Really.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:09.180
That is enough for today.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.290
See you tomorrow.

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.750
Not so fast.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.860
You stupid idiot.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.000
Are you really leaving empty-handed?

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:23.100
Play with me a bit.

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:26.030
Don't. That's when he shows his true self.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:29.240
I see, so you want to die today.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.210
Ready, Yoko?

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:32.240
Yup.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:36.380
In the name of the wise Hakusan.
Frog, smash your enemy.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.380
Evil Blaze.

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.220
Did we get him?

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.330
Don't relax just yet. Most likely not.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:52.860
- He's gone?
- Keita.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:59.130
Are you surprised, Mr. Inukami User?

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:04.740
Against a Reaper's black robe, your fire and charms are useless.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:08.540
Oh, Xing Yi Quan?

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.950
But it lacks dedication.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.420
Ouch.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.060
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.920
- Frog...
- Keita!

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:25.560
- You did it!
- I don't think so.

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:31.930
Now you've done it, Mr. Inukami User.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.100
I hold back, and this is how you thank me?

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.810
Very well, give me your best shot.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.140
I shall fight back with the same technique.

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:43.250
It's part of the agreement after all.

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:47.920
Kei Sindo, you watch a little longer.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:48.820
However...

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.990
Sebastian, you aren't needed.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:14:59.130
Sebastian.

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:00.430
Hey, Reaper.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.470
Don't do anything.

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:07.900
Be quiet and enjoy the banquet of despair that's about to begin.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:12.610
It's show time. Slaughter time.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.240
Stop showing off.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.280
You.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.120
Oh my, what an energetic Inukami Yoko.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.580
You, you, you.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:23.850
I'm intrigued.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.560
Let me have a peek at your fears.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:34.530
Yoko!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.330
Dogs.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.630
What did you do to her?

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:42.740
I am one that rules over fear.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.240
As long as I see someone,

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:48.510
I can sense their fear and easily trap them inside it.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.380
Just like this.

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:59.590
Be afraid. Show me your fears.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:06.330
Keita, who's Maiko?

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.600
You cheater. I won't forgive you.

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:13.340
Oh my, Mr. Keita.
Where are you going at this hour?

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:17.510
Keita, do you think love that transcends species exist?

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:21.980
There's no need to hold back.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:24.650
Come on, let's do it.

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:26.380
Stop it.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:30.950
I'm not ready to start a family!

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:36.960
What a terrifying attack.

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:38.930
But it doesn't seem to work on me.

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:43.100
Don't you have a proper fear?

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.100
Shut up.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:48.740
That trick of yours won't work on me. It's over!

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:52.240
My trick? This? How foolish.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:55.010
You haven't seen anything yet.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:59.510
You're lying.
Then, prove it to me.

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:04.850
You call that provocation?
Very well.

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:08.860
Our difference in power is like that of heaven and earth.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:13.530
Now, listen to the song played by despair.

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:33.280
So you're the heiress of the Sindo family.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.250
Do entertain me, little bundle of life.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:43.120
Hey Sebastian, why don't I have a father or mother?

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.130
Why?

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.230
It's boring.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:51.030
I don't want a birthday like this anymore.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:53.800
I want to have a party like everybody else.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.240
Miss, forgive me.

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:58.940
Happy birthday
Kei

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:01.880
Kei, happy birthday.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:03.650
Go on, blow out the candles.

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:05.280
Okay.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:10.220
Kei Sindo, quite a curious thing you're doing.

00:18:10.220 --> 00:18:12.490
Don't get in our way.

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:16.690
So you're old enough to confront me, huh?

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:28.500
Oh, my.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.810
Everything that humans own sure are quite fragile.

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:35.410
Worry not, Kei Sindo.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:38.250
As per the contract,
I will not kill anybody today.

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:42.020
After all, I was going easy on you.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:47.620
Ah, I truly love how you look when you're scared.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.990
Kei, the last of the Sindo family.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:59.730
Kei's birthday is tomorrow.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:03.370
Don't break your promise.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.970
Tomorrow, I...

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:12.350
I will definitely beat you...

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.020
How interesting, Mr. Inukami User.

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:20.360
Very well then.
Tomorrow you shall show me.

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:23.360
Your useless resistance.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:29.660
And I shall tell you all about true fears.

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:52.890
That's why I told you to leave.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.160
I've had enough of this.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:58.130
The Reaper can take my life.

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.430
I've had enough.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:05.070
I can't watch others get hurt or die.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:19.780
Hey.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.150
Oh, you're up?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.750
Yeah. Thanks for this.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:25.620
Keep it.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:29.690
I mean, the mansion we were supposed to give you is destroyed.

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:34.060
Now, go home.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.630
Are you sure?

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.230
Of course.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:39.930
Oh, that's right.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:42.940
Will you listen to my last wish?

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:44.270
What is it?

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:49.410
When you go, can you take Sebastian even if you have to punch him?

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:53.780
Because he'll probably say he'll stay by my side.

00:20:57.590 --> 00:21:00.020
Good bye. I wish you happiness.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:09.600
I think you're a great singer.

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:10.830
Thanks.

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:49.840
<i>To those whose screams</i> <i>have nowhere to go</i>

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:57.880
<i>Cry out loud and live an exciting life</i>

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:05.820
<i>Even if my prayers made</i> <i>from dissipating tears</i>

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:13.930
<i>Are in the hands of merciless death</i>

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:30.410
<i>I'm fine with that</i>

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:55.840
Next episode preview

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:59.970
Everything was crushed in the face of an overwhelming power.

00:22:59.970 --> 00:23:03.380
The girl who kept looking at despair sings the song of death.

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:06.250
The Reaper laughs loudly from the darkness.

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:08.620
The chains of sorrow do not end.

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:11.750
The future is painted with darkness.

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:17.090
At that very moment, a single person stood up to fight back.

00:23:17.860 --> 00:23:19.460
Next on "Inukami!"

00:23:20.030 --> 00:23:22.730
But to Me, it's Your Song!
"But to Me, it's Your Song!"

00:23:22.730 --> 00:23:24.970
Does light exist there?
